WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.406 --> 00:00:03.397
检查保留的第1级目录 / Inspect retained folder level 1

2
00:00:03.397 --> 00:00:06.450
检查保留的第2级目录 / Inspect retained folder level 2

3
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:09.495
检查保留的第3级目录 / Inspect retained folder level 3

4
00:00:09.495 --> 00:00:12.595
打开同一个保存请求 / Open the same saved request

5
00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:15.642
核对Header值与启停状态 / Verify Header values and enabled states

6
00:00:15.642 --> 00:00:18.663
核对未重填的Query行 / Verify the Query row without refilling it

7
00:00:18.663 --> 00:00:21.886
核对实际回载的JSON正文 / Verify the actually restored JSON body

8
00:00:21.886 --> 00:00:24.930
核对实际回载的公开Auth字段 / Verify the restored public Auth field

9
00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:27.995
仅在重启后Send一次核对实际字节 / Send once after restart and verify actual bytes

10
00:00:27.995 --> 00:00:31.060
清空演示Auth值 / Clear the demonstration Auth value

11
00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:34.978
恢复Auth None并等待保存 / Restore Auth None and wait for saving
